        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Jackson, Joe Strummer\n- Organizations: the Clash\n- Products: Moonwalk, The Essential Clash\n- Topics: music, autobiography, punk rock\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Jackson was born on August 29, 1958, and he was an American singer, songwriter, and dancer.\n- Joe Strummer was born as John Graham Mellor on 21 August 1952, and he was an English musician, singer, actor, and songwriter.\n- The Clash was a punk rock band formed in 1976 as part of the original wave of British punk.\n- Joe Strummer was the co-founder, lyricist, rhythm guitarist, and lead vocalist of the Clash.\n- Moonwalk is a 1988 autobiography written by American recording artist Michael Jackson.\n- Joe Strummer died on 22 December 2002.\n- The Essential Clash is dedicated to Joe Strummer, who died during its compilation.\n- Michael Jackson died on June 25, 2009.",
